OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as mouldy dumped post is    
OL,4,Adelivered weeks later                  
OL,6,FRoyal Mail customers have been left    
OL,7,Ffurious after hundreds of letters      
OL,8,Ffailed to arrive in a town - and those 
OL,9,Fthat did were delivered damaged and    
OL,10,Fmouldy weeks later.                    
OL,12,FThe firm has apologised and blamed the 
OL,13,Fincident in Attleborough on post being 
OL,14,Fdumped at Toll's Meadow nature reserve 
OL,15,Fin neighbouring Wymondham, Norfolk. The
OL,16,Freserve's warden reported the discovery
OL,17,Fto Royal Mail.                         
OL,19,FComplaints included damaged medication,
OL,20,Fmoney sent by relatives going missing -
OL,21,Fand important documents delivered in a 
OL,22,Fpoor state or not turning up at all.   
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
