OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as mouldy dumped post is    
OL,4,Adelivered weeks later                  
OL,6,FThe town's Conservative MP, George     
OL,7,FFreeman, said Royal Mail needed to "get
OL,8,Fa grip", adding: "This is appalling and
OL,9,Fneeds to be addressed as a matter of   
OL,10,Fpriority."                             
